            "y": 200,
            "width": 260,
            "height": 100,
            "color": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "note_stack",
            "text": "**Stack (concat)** merges 4 scalar inputs into a 4-lane array: [a, b, c, d]. This creates a lane set where element 0 is LFO A, element 1 is LFO B, etc.",
