            "y": 200,
            "width": 280,
            "height": 120,
            "color": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "note_scalar",
            "text": "**Y and R are scalar** They auto-broadcast into the lane set established by Stack. All 4 balls share the same Y position and radius.",
